    Strathcarron Council services landing page. PR-A ships with the
    Driving Licence card live (the F126 page, moved here from
    Sorcha.UI.Web.Client) and the Blue Badge card as a "coming soon"
    placeholder. PR-C of Feature 127 activates the Blue Badge card.
