@page "/"

<PageTitle>Strathcarron Council — services</PageTitle>

<h1>Council services</h1>
<p>
    Apply for council services online. Most services are linked to your
    Strathcarron Council account; once you've applied for one, the next
    time you apply we'll already know who you are.
</p>

<div class="service-grid">
    <article class="service-card">
        <h3>Driving Licence</h3>
        <p>Apply for or renew your driving licence. New applicants will be issued a Strathcarron Assured Identity credential when their application is accepted.</p>
        <a class="cta" href="/services/driving-licence">Apply for a driving licence →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="service-card coming-soon">
        <span class="pill-soon">Coming soon</span>
        <h3>Blue Badge</h3>
        <p>Apply for a Blue Badge parking permit. This service uses your existing Assured Identity, so most of the form is filled in for you.</p>
        <span class="cta" style="color: var(--council-muted);">Available shortly</span>
    </article>
</div>

<h2>Other services</h2>
<p style="color: var(--council-muted);">
    Council Tax, refuse collection, planning applications and other services
    are available at our service desk in person — online applications for
    those services are being added over the coming months.
</p>
